{"seq":2,"slug":"payout-idempotent-statemachine","title":"出款幂等与状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-seller-payout-orchestration/batch-payout-execution/payout-idempotent-statemachine","wordCount":2484,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"出款幂等与状态机\">出款幂等与状态机</h1><p>一个出款系统最贵的一类缺陷是一个字：<strong>重</strong>。重复提交一笔出款意味着钱打出去两次，而追回多打的那一笔要靠对方自愿退回——现实中成功率取决于对方是善意还是装死，周期以周计。重复不只在网络重试时发生，它有五个常见来源：应用层的超时重试、消息队列的至少一次投递、合作方接口返回超时但实际已受理、批处理作业被重复调度、以及人工在后台点了两次「重新提交」。<strong>幂等与状态机的全部意义就是让这五种重复都收敛到同一个结果。</strong></p>\n<p>与之镜像的另一类缺陷是一个字：<strong>漏</strong>。一笔出款既没成功也没失败，永远停在中间状态，资金被冻结着、卖家在问钱什么时候到、系统里没有任何东西会推动它——这类「卡住的出款」在早期系统里非常常见，原因是状态机缺少超时与调和机制。本节的核心就是把这两个缺陷都堵上：<strong>用幂等键让重复无害，用状态机与调和让悬空可解。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"幂等键的设计-标识-出款意图-而非-请求\">幂等键的设计：标识「出款意图」而非「请求」</h3><p>幂等键的正确语义是「这代表同一次出款意图」。它的设计直接决定了它能挡住哪些重复。</p>\n<p>错误的键是随机的请求 ID——它只能挡住「同一个请求被重发两次」，挡不住「应用层生成了两个请求对象但表达同一意图」。</p>\n<p>错误程度稍轻但仍有问题的是「卖家 ID + 账期」——它在<strong>同一账期只出款一次</strong>这个业务假设下有效，但一旦出现「一个账期分两次出款」（部分提前结付）、或「同一账期因退回而重出」，这个键就会挡住合法的第二次出款。</p>\n<p>正确的键应当由<strong>出款意图的全部决定性字段</strong>构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>idem_key</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>payee_id</mtext><mo>∥</mo><mtext>currency</mtext><mo>∥</mo><mtext>net_amount</mtext><mo>∥</mo><mtext>settlement_period</mtext><mo>∥</mo><mtext>payout_purpose</mtext><mo>∥</mo><mtext>attempt</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{idem\\_key} = H(\\text{payee\\_id} \\parallel \\text{currency} \\parallel \\text{net\\_amount} \\parallel \\text{settlement\\_period} \\parallel \\text{payout\\_purpose} \\parallel \\text{attempt})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">idem_key</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payee_id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">currency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">net_amount</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">settlement_period</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout_purpose</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">attempt</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>attempt</code> 是一个显式的尝试序号（默认 0）。退回后重出时 <code>attempt</code> 递增，从而得到一个新键；而网络重试时 <code>attempt</code> 不变，键也不变，因此被幂等地去重。这个设计的价值在于它把「这是同一件事的重试」与「这是一件新的事」这两个语义明确区分开，而不是靠猜测。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE payout_item (&#10;  payout_item_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  payee_id        BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  settlement_period TEXT      NOT NULL,&#10;  payout_purpose  TEXT        NOT NULL,      -- seller_settlement / creator_tip / refund_reissue ...&#10;  attempt         SMALLINT    NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  gross_amount    NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  net_amount      NUMERIC(20,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency        CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  rail_id         TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  status          TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  status_version  INTEGER     NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  external_ref    TEXT,                      -- 合作方给的唯一引用&#10;  rejected_reason TEXT,                      -- 不参与幂等键，仅记录&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  updated_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (idempotency_key)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> payout_item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payout_item_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payee_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settlement_period </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payout_purpose  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- seller_settlement / creator_tip / refund_reissue ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempt         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gross_amount    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_amount      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rail_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  status_version  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  external_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 合作方给的唯一引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rejected_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 不参与幂等键，仅记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>rejected_reason</code> 被明确排除在幂等键之外。原因很实际：第一次尝试因为账户问题失败，第二次尝试修正了账户但金额不变——这两次是「同一出款意图的两次尝试」，但如果把失败原因编进键里，它们就变成两个不同的键，去重会失效。<strong>幂等键应当只由业务意图的稳定字段构成，不包含任何过程性字段。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"状态集合的设计\">状态集合的设计</h3><p>状态机的状态设计有三个原则：<strong>命名表达语义而非技术步骤</strong>、<strong>区分「未知」与「失败」</strong>、<strong>终态与中间态清晰分离</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; created: 批次构建产出&#10;    created --&gt; queued: 通过提交前检查&#10;    queued --&gt; submitting: 提交动作开始&#10;    submitting --&gt; accepted: 合作方明确受理&#10;    submitting --&gt; unknown: 超时/网络错误/无法判定&#10;    submitting --&gt; rejected: 合作方明确拒绝&#10;    unknown --&gt; accepted: 调和确认已受理&#10;    unknown --&gt; rejected: 调和确认未受理&#10;    accepted --&gt; in_flight: 进入清算网络&#10;    in_flight --&gt; settled: 清算完成且资金可用&#10;    in_flight --&gt; returned: 网络退回&#10;    accepted --&gt; returned: 受理后被退回&#10;    returned --&gt; resolved: 冲正完成&#10;    settled --&gt; [*]&#10;    rejected --&gt; [*]&#10;    resolved --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; created: 批次构建产出\n    created --&gt; queued: 通过提交前检查\n    queued --&gt; submitting: 提交动作开始\n    submitting --&gt; accepted: 合作方明确受理\n    submitting --&gt; unknown: 超时/网络错误/无法判定\n    submitting --&gt; rejected: 合作方明确拒绝\n    unknown --&gt; accepted: 调和确认已受理\n    unknown --&gt; rejected: 调和确认未受理\n    accepted --&gt; in_flight: 进入清算网络\n    in_flight --&gt; settled: 清算完成且资金可用\n    in_flight --&gt; returned: 网络退回\n    accepted --&gt; returned: 受理后被退回\n    returned --&gt; resolved: 冲正完成\n    settled --&gt; [*]\n    rejected --&gt; [*]\n    resolved --&gt; [*]</pre><p>三个设计要点值得展开。</p>\n<p><strong><code>unknown</code> 必须独立存在</strong>。这是最容易被合并掉、也最容易出事的两个状态之一。当合作方接口超时或返回不可判定的错误时，这笔出款「可能已受理」——把它当作 <code>rejected</code> 处理会导致漏付（合作方其实收了），当作 <code>accepted</code> 处理会在没有外部凭证的情况下推进（可能实际没受理）。唯一正确的做法是进入 <code>unknown</code> 并触发调和。</p>\n<p><strong><code>rejected</code> 是终态但 <code>returned</code> 不是</strong>。<code>rejected</code> 表示出款指令从未被受理（提交前就被拒），不存在资金移动，是干净的终态。<code>returned</code> 表示钱曾经出去过又回来了，它必然伴随账务冲回，冲回完成后才到 <code>resolved</code>。</p>\n<p><strong><code>in_flight</code> 与 <code>accepted</code> 的区分表达了「谁在负责」</strong>。<code>accepted</code> 是合作方已受理但尚未进入清算网络（比如批次已生成但还没到网络的提交窗口），<code>in_flight</code> 是已进入网络。这个区分让「为什么这笔钱已经三天没动了」这个问题有明确的答案——是卡在合作方，还是卡在网络。</p>\n<h3 id=\"状态转移必须显式-有向-且带守卫\">状态转移必须显式、有向、且带守卫</h3><p>状态机的实现方式决定了它能否被安全地演进。最差的方式是在业务代码里散落的 <code>if status == X: update to Y</code>。正确的方式是把转移表做成数据，并在每次转移时校验守卫条件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;transitions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;created&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;queued&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;precheck_passed&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;queued&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;submitting&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;batch_ready&quot;, &quot;not_cutoff_passed&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;submitting&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;accepted&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;external_ref_present&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;submitting&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;timeout_or_ambiguous&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;submitting&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;explicit_reject_code&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;accepted&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;reconcile_confirmed_accepted&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;reconcile_confirmed_absent&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;accepted&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;in_flight&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;network_ack&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;accepted&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;returned&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;return_code_present&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;in_flight&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;settled&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;settlement_confirmed&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;in_flight&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;returned&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;return_code_present&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;from&quot;: &quot;returned&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;resolved&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: [&quot;reversal_posted&quot;] }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;terminal&quot;: [&quot;settled&quot;, &quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;resolved&quot;],&#10;  &quot;forbidden&quot;: [&#10;    [&quot;settled&quot;, &quot;created&quot;],&#10;    [&quot;rejected&quot;, &quot;accepted&quot;],&#10;    [&quot;resolved&quot;, &quot;in_flight&quot;]&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;timeout_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;submitting&quot;: { &quot;after&quot;: &quot;PT2M&quot;, &quot;to&quot;: &quot;unknown&quot; },&#10;    &quot;accepted&quot;: { &quot;after&quot;: &quot;P3D&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;escalate_ops&quot;, &quot;not_to_state&quot;: true },&#10;    &quot;in_flight&quot;: { &quot;after&quot;: &quot;P7D&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;escalate_ops&quot;, &quot;not_to_state&quot;: true }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"transitions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#